    "next_steps": {
      "value": "1. Copy state_bucket below into envs/stage.backend.hcl (the bucket\n   name contains a random token, so it is not predictable - you must copy it).\n2. Copy the two role ARNs into GitHub repository VARIABLES (not secrets):\n     AWS_TF_PLAN_ROLE_STAGE  = \u003ctf_plan_role_arn\u003e\n     AWS_TF_APPLY_ROLE_STAGE = \u003ctf_apply_role_arn\u003e\n3. Confirm config/main.tf has the right account_id for stage.\n4. Commit envs/stage.backend.hcl and bootstrap/terraform.tfstate.\n",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "state_bucket": {
      "value": "scribl-stage-tfstate-fxiju7",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "tf_apply_role_arn": {
      "value": "arn:aws:iam::419717495525:role/scribl-stage-tf-apply",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "tf_plan_role_arn": {
